# Breakpoints. Set one in the gutter, then click "Debug IC10" above the test.
# - A plain breakpoint on the "add" line stops once a tick.
# - Right-click it, Edit Breakpoint, Expression: Counter == 5 (stops once, with Counter at 5).
# - Right-click the "mul" line, Add Logpoint: count {Counter}, double {Double}
#   It prints to the Debug Console instead of stopping.
alias Counter r0
alias Double r1
loop:
add Counter Counter 1
mul Double Counter 2
s db Setting Double
yield
j loop
